Subject: Prediction of input distribution based on output distribution?
Message-ID: <9p01n03Dnfk.xWleOZb2AQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/9p01n03Dnfk/m/xWleOZb2AQAJ>
