Subject: Re: [stan-users] Sum of lognormals?
Message-ID: <Jwp-I_B_2wQ.sqfaVgM7AwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <Jwp-I_B_2wQ.6-Q10BolAwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
