The problem is in this addition:

b0[id[n]]  +   beta * xmat[n]

---------      ----   -------
vec[J]     mat[C,K]   vec[K]
           ------------------
               vec[C]

which doesn't match these declarations:

  vector[J] b0[C];            # county intercepts

  matrix[C,K] beta;           # effects coefficients

  vector[K] xmat[N];        # predictors

The right hand side is a C-vector and the left a J-vector.

- Bob

